OL,3,APope praises 'energy and commitment' of
OL,4,Ayoung people as huge crowds join
OL,5,Aopen-air Mass in Paris
OL,6,
OL,7,FPope Leo XIV praised the "enthusiasm,
OL,8,Fenergy and commitment" young people
OL,9,Fbring to the Catholic Church as thick
OL,10,Fcrowds attended an open-air Mass in
OL,11,FParis.
OL,13,FAn estimated 700,000 people had
OL,14,Fgathered for the Mass celebrated by the
OL,15,FPope from a special altar on the Place
OL,16,Fde la Concorde, on the second day of
OL,17,Fhis four-day visit to France.
OL,19,FIt began after the Pope rode down the
OL,20,FChamps-Elysees Avenue waving to crowds
OL,21,Ffrom his open-topped popemobile.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
